# Zakk <zakk@gentoozh.org> (2026-10-21)
# Tencent moved the .deb to archive storage (COS returns InvalidObjectState),
# so the official download URL returns 403 and the package cannot be fetched.
# Removal on 2026-11-20.
media-sound/qqmusic

# Zakk <zakk@gentoozh.org> (2026-10-21)
# Qv2ray has made no release since 2021, and upstream archived its plugins and
# dev-libs/qnodeeditor, which only qv2ray uses. The stable net-libs/grpc that
# qv2ray depends on does not support Python 3.14, so qv2ray and its plugins
# fail to build on stable.
# Removal on 2026-11-20.
dev-libs/qnodeeditor
net-proxy/qv2ray
net-proxy/qvplugin-command
net-proxy/qvplugin-ss
net-proxy/qvplugin-trojan
net-proxy/qvplugin-trojan-go

# Zakk <zakk@gentoozh.org> (2026-10-09)
# Unmaintained.
# Removal on 2026-11-09.
app-misc/copilot

# Xianggang Wang <dev@wangxianggang.com> (2026-09-29)
# Motrix Next is superseded by net-misc/rayburst-bin. Rayburst does not import
# its settings, tasks or history; finish active downloads before switching.
# Removal on 2026-10-29.
net-misc/motrix-next-bin

# Zakk <zakk@gentoozh.org> (2026-08-12)
# This legacy release is no longer updated. arm64 and loong users should use
# app-office/wps-office365-edu, which supports offline use.
=app-office/wps-office-11.1.0.11719-r2

# jinqiang zhang <peeweep@0x0.ee> (2026-08-09)
# gentoo-zh's virtual/dist-kernel is incompatible with ::gentoo's
# virtual/dist-kernel, only gentoo-zh's xanmod-kernel, gentoo-cjk-kernel
# and gentoo-cjk-kernel-bin use it.
# Manually unmask it if you need any of them.
virtual/dist-kernel
